tip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Healers_Bounty\" title=\"Healers Bounty\">Healers Bounty</a>:</b> This shield has a small percentage chance to cast a <a href=\"/page/Heal_spell\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heal spell\">Heal spell</a> on you when you take damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sonic_Guard\" title=\"Sonic Guard\">Sonic&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sonic_Guard\" title=\"Sonic Guard\">Sonic&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This item blasts those that attack the wearer, causing 1d6 sonic damage on a successful melee attack.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mithral\" title=\"Mithral\">Mithral</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mithral\" title=\"Mithral\">Mithral</a>:</b> <b>Mithral</b> armor is one type lighter then normal. Arcane Spell Failure decreased by 10%. Maximum dexterity bonus increased by 2. Armor check penalty reduced by 3.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Levik&#39;s_Defender\" title=\"Named item sets\">Levik's Defender</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Levik&#39;s_Defender\" title=\"Named item sets\">Levik's Defender</a>:</b> With 2 items equipped - +3 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to AC, 20% Additional Melee Threat, Unlisted Fortitude and Will Save +1 (Stacks with most but not Parrying/Greater Parrying).  With 3 items equipped - +5 insight AC, 30% Additional Melee Threat (Threat stacks, but only with non-like amounts)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;background:#CCEEFF\"><i>This relic of the Silver Flame was supposedly once worn by the powerful paladin Levik. Levik and his brother Lorikk disappeared many years ago while investigating tales of an ancient creature residing beneath Stormreach.</i>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817221649\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.126 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4166/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29038/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8113/2097152 byte